{"id":"shotcut","name":"Shotcut","tagline":"Video editor","blurb":"Cross-platform editor that opens whatever format you have, without importing first.","description":"Shotcut is a free and open-source cross-platform video editing application for\n Windows, macOS, and Linux.\n \n\n \n Shotcut supports many video, audio, and image formats via FFmpeg and screen,\n webcam, and audio capture. It uses a time-line for non-linear video editing of\n multiple tracks that may be composed of various file formats. Scrubbing and\n transport control are assisted by OpenGL GPU-based processing and a number of\n video and audio filters are available.","developer":"Meltytech, LLC","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/shotcut/Shotcut/6740996b9caf645b4d2d71211d68fd3f/icons/128x128/org.shotcut.Shotcut.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/shotcut/Shotcut/6740996b9caf645b4d2d71211d68fd3f/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/shotcut/Shotcut/6740996b9caf645b4d2d71211d68fd3f/screenshots/image-1_752x464@1.png","w":1282,"h":792},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/shotcut/Shotcut/6740996b9caf645b4d2d71211d68fd3f/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/shotcut/Shotcut/6740996b9caf645b4d2d71211d68fd3f/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","w":736,"h":500},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/shotcut/Shotcut/6740996b9caf645b4d2d71211d68fd3f/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/shotcut/Shotcut/6740996b9caf645b4d2d71211d68fd3f/screenshots/image-3_752x629@1.png","w":957,"h":801},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/shotcut/Shotcut/6740996b9caf645b4d2d71211d68fd3f/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/shotcut/Shotcut/6740996b9caf645b4d2d71211d68fd3f/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","w":765,"h":297},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/shotcut/Shotcut/6740996b9caf645b4d2d71211d68fd3f/screenshots/image-5_orig.png","thumb":"https:/